00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-07-30T23:18:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T20:33:36Z","closed_at":"2025-07-31T15:44:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis is only reproducible on the current TIP. It was introduced in the last few days at most.\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (2a9ff3926) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6950 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21013.1000) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.90 GiB memory\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (2a9ff3926) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6950 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21013.1000) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.90 GiB memory\n\nThis happens with both Firefox and Chrome running the project\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn a Web export, with nothreads, when using `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request` to start loading a resource (here: a scene), and `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_get_status` plus `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_get` when the status is `THREAD_LOAD_LOADED`, the status will never stop being `THREAD_LOAD_IN_PROGRESS`, with progress `0.0`.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make two new scenes, a loader and a loaded scene\n2. put some label in them to see which one is visible\n3. attach script to `loader` scene\n4. Code a loading loop using `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request` \n5. Run on desktop, web and web_nothreads and observe\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI created a project with everything needed here: \n[mrp-threaded-loads.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21519253/mrp-threaded-loads.zip)\n\nuse the included export configurations with the current TIP version of Godotengine","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}